Emerging Opportunities
Smart Pipeline Monitoring
Pipeline operators can use DAS to identify potential third-party interference, monitor activity near critical routes, and strengthen security programs. Combining sensing with operational data may further support asset integrity and maintenance planning.

Railway and Transportation Security
Railway networks provide opportunities for distributed sensing because of their long routes and need for continuous monitoring. DAS can help identify activity near tracks, detect disturbances, and complement existing railway safety and security systems.

AI-Enabled Predictive Maintenance
Advances in machine learning and signal analysis create opportunities to identify unusual vibration patterns that may indicate developing equipment or infrastructure problems. Integrating DAS with digital monitoring platforms could improve maintenance planning and help operators prioritize inspections.

Together, these applications create opportunities for providers offering reliable sensing hardware, advanced analytics, and solutions tailored to the operational requirements of specific industries.

